{"id":"o-paddlecanyonlake-com","title":"Paddle Canyon Lake","cat":"water","art":"kayak","area":"Canyon Lake, TX","metroId":"austin","src":"paddlecanyonlake.com","specs":[],"options":[],"services":[],"includes":[],"addons":[],"gap":"What experiences or services are offered","blurb":"茶道具の雑学としては、茶道が日本国内で完成を見たまでの概略を抑えておくのは有益です。日本国内に茶が初めて入ってきたのは遣唐使を通じてのことでした。禅宗の寺院で喫茶の風習は紹介され、禅宗に帰依した武士や承認を通じて広く喫茶は伝播していきます。室町時代には幕府の重要な典礼に位置付けられ、八代将軍足利義政が京都東山に茶室を初めて作りました。その後、従来の茶道を簡素化した「わび茶」を千利休が完成させて、茶道具も注目をあつめることになったわけです。","cover":"https://www.paddlecanyonlake.com/gazo-/photo.png","photos":["https://www.paddlecanyonlake.com/gazo-/photo.png","https://www.paddlecanyonlake.com/gazo-/photo1.png","https://www.paddlecanyonlake.com/gazo-/photo2.png","https://www.paddlecanyonlake.com/gazo-/shita.png"],"ytVideos":[],"lat":29.8671402,"lon":-98.2434883,"tags":[],"highlights":[],"requirements":[],"groupInfo":[],"bring":[],"policies":[],"hoursText":[],"faq":[],"contact":{"domain":"paddlecanyonlake.com","phone":null,"street":"1178 Comal Park Road","city":"Canyon Lake","region":"TX","postal":"78133","hours":[]}}